  "decision_date": "09/06/2021",
  "description": "Variation of condition 2 (approved plans) to allow alterations to approved plans following planning permission 00248/590/P14 dated 29/05/2020 for erection of two storey rear extension above the existing ground floor rear kitchen flat roof to add 2x2bed self-contained flats and addition of a flat roof on the main building and mansard roof on the side extension to create new third floor for use as 1x3bed self-contained flat and 2x1bed self-contained flats (Class C3)",
  "site_name": "The Gunnersbury",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "03/06/2021",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "W4 5RP",
  "street_name": "Chiswick High Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "lapsed_date": "08/06/2024",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before 29th May 2023.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (New Documents:\r\nP07(G), P08(G), P10(G), received 24/05/2021, P09(Rev.F), Unnumbered 1s/2nd/3rd Floor Plans and Design and Access Statement, received 19/04/2021, Construction Management Plan, Egress Plan, Route/Access Map and Site Storage Plan, received 22/12/2020, and WC01(Rev.A) and WC02(Rev.A), received 04/12/2020. \r\nOriginal Documents:P06(Rev.C) and Energy Statement and Solar Panel Specifications, received 18/05/2020, P05(Rev.B), received 17/04/2020, and L01, EX01, EX02, EX03, EX04, EX05, EX06, EX07, EX08, EX09, S01, P01 and P02, received 23/03/2020) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8:00am  to 6:00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9 :00am to 1:00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extensions hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building (matching brickwork with sliding sash timber windows, together with black-painted metal railings for the balconies), unless otherwise indicated on the approved drawings.",
    "Condition : 5 - The development shall be carried out in accordance with the Construction Management Plan hereby approved, which shall be adhered to throughout the construction period.",
    "Condition : 6 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the approved waste and recycling details, which shall be fully implemented before any part of the accommodation hereby permitted is occupied and thereafter retained as such. Further guidance on appropriate capacity and other details is available in the Council's Refuse and Recycling Guidelines (request from Officer).",
    "Condition : 7 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the approved cycle storage details, with the approved facilities fully implemented before any part of the accommodation hereby permitted is occupied and thereafter retained as such. Further guidance on appropriate dimensions, layouts, and stands is available in the West London Cycle Parking Guidance.",
    "Condition : 8 - No additional windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the side walls of the dwelling hereby approved and no additional doors inserted in the building without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority."
  ],
